{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_vrtx_01TLTUFdGDTDpx1jF3spQiXD","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"claude-opus-4-7","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture. The grilling skill exists, and the plan_prompt.go already has grilling. I need to write a test that verifies task3's implementation (adding grilling to easy.md and easy_prompt.go).\n\nI'll use `plan_prompt_test.go` as a model for what the easy prompt grilling test should look like. The test script needs to check:\n\n1. Static: `easy.md` has `{{grilling_skill_path}}`\n2. Static: `easy.md` has \"追加\" (append) for requirement.md\n3. Static: `easy.md` does not have \"覆写\" or \"重写\"\n4. Static: `easy_prompt.go` writes the grilling skill file and sets the grilling_skill_path variable\n5. Static: `easy_prompt.go` includes the grilling file in the skill files list\n6. Runtime: The new TestEasyPromptGrilling test passes\n7. Runtime: The full test suite passes overall\n\nNow I'll write the test script.","signature":""}],"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f0cfcb32-93b7-4220-832d-8f965574abd7","uuid":"18ca5513-907d-4042-b665-3661b2f9d8ae"}
